{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grav My Balls is a first person shooter/ puzzle game where you change the gravity on certain objects you shoot. Turn gravity on, off, or lock in place by shooting balls out of the mysterious attachments built into your hands. Use your balls and your wits to traverse and solve puzzles within the strange location you are stuck in. You will unlock special modified balls along your journey to help you solve puzzles and figure out why you are here. Do you have the balls to get out alive?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748050?t=1760126764","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748050/6f6675835f8cc55278e2bf480845d15916a28e66/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760126764","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748050/8ef28f32ee266d2ae09d58f19056f938cf79db88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760126764","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748050/8ef28f32ee266d2ae09d58f19056f938cf79db88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760126764","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3755840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Regular Update</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748050/extras/c512e995362d7bcd08711053d624f7be.avif?t=1760126764\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grav My Balls is featured among many other indie games at next week's Steam Next Fest. I have updated the demo with some quality of life features and it is running better then ever. Please give the newer build a shot along with many other indie games.\u00a0</p></p><